Narrative: Modular DeFi / Composable Primitives
Status: Secondary Narrative
Evidence: V4 Spokes as modular lending modules; Aave V3.3 for Horizon; Aave Kit (planned developer toolkit); Lens Protocol (social graph, spun out)
Sources:
https://aave.com/docs/aave-v4 (Phase 4)
https://www.gate.com (Phase 2 L9)
https://www.htx.com (Phase 2 L29-L30)

Narrative: Layer 2 / Multi-Chain Expansion
Status: Main Narrative (Historical, now mature)
Evidence: Deployed on 16+ chains (Ethereum, Polygon, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Avalanche, BNB, Fantom, Harmony, Gnosis, Scroll, Metis, ZKsync, Linea, Mantle, Plasma); L2Pool optimization
